{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "de76005c36934bcbcaa07592dce6295bf6c39baccd147d50337640fa7c4bf262", "ja": "お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "大家辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "801e6089fd7b4953679313a5d6167298a1f520923c19a60a20d177b5610fbd19", "ja": "やれやれ、これでクランクアップか……。\n無事に撮影が終わってよかったよ。", "zh": "真是的，这下就杀青了啊……\n能顺利拍摄结束，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "022de99cffb538b3e6093105f47b6f372b504cf89842e694eaf673ee0927528e", "ja": "はい。最初は、わたしにできるのかなって、\n不安でしたけど……最後まで演じられてよかったです！", "zh": "是的。刚开始我还担心自己能不能做到……能顺利演到最后，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c5f2f34d7e35c58822e242567317c1baa78b61ef4b0e69669e8dc78525e5735", "ja": "でも、アレには驚きましたよね～。\n別パターンも撮っておく、ってやつ。", "zh": "不过，那个还是让人很惊讶呢～\n就是还要把另一个版本也拍下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "800f5888febcc2bf11504444a9f1d509084d05e6d62b1a20c3fc693d14e579c6", "ja": "初日にやった、クライマックスですね！\nあのシーンだけ、2パターン撮ったんですよね。", "zh": "就是第一天拍的高潮戏吧！光是那个场景，就拍了2种版本呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "015d22c056eca2c07cc48858ce43525ad684fc8df7fccef9fc73ba56b729a1a1", "ja": "全体を通して、相応しい方を使うって言ってたな。\nどっちが使われるか……よし、みんな賭けてみないか？", "zh": "记得说过，要根据整体效果选更合适的那个。\n到底会用哪一个……好，大家要不要来赌一把？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "a8ea9acf9e476b8f3478eb9abe95a9ad148c25718435fe1b89f1eecf448c303b", "ja": "ジュリア、デスゲームに影響されてるの。\nミキはー……先にやったほうだと思うな。", "zh": "茱莉亚，你这是受死亡游戏影响了吧。\n美希觉得——应该是先做的那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8f337fef9540a139cd9b77959b353334c254f8e2a677dd18640cbcc45dd3b37c", "ja": "いや、美希も乗ってるじゃん……あれ？\nそういえば、麗花はどこ？", "zh": "不是，美希你不也挺起劲的吗……咦？\n话说回来，丽花去哪了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "58868aa58a40c0cd9cd69fd8e8ad3ae62ce7f9649dc5ce1d11921991e11aeb8d", "ja": "レイなら、{$P$}に\n話があるからって、出て行ったぜ。", "zh": "丽花啊，说是有话要跟{$P$}谈，就出去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "3b1bebe1d902fda52d951fc428126bf4ab3c2e96a2ad6ec04c3cbff36519ccb8", "ja": "そうなんですね。けど、撮影は終わったのに、\nまだ何かあったんでしょうか？", "zh": "这样啊。不过拍摄已经结束了，她还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2995426c30961f3f25ff7ad18efcb204d2becb945ec21ca60e07ff66f5d4b6fa", "ja": "もしかして……\nご褒美をもらいに行ったのかも！？", "zh": "难道说……\n是去领取奖励了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "57ab3ae13da41ad3e17610281751f0b07c2bcfe47791fa9e79a19ece65c1ddec", "ja": "えーっ！？　麗花ってば、抜けがけはズルいの！\nミキも、ご褒美考えなくちゃ。", "zh": "诶——！？丽花居然抢先一步，太狡猾了！\n美希也得想想要什么奖励才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "049f62c4741414c0311168219410a37789842a2912ef8c4f81b70cecff7a3dd8", "ja": "ご褒美……わたしは{$P$}さんに、\nいっぱいほめてほしいです！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "奖励……我想让{$P$}先生多多夸奖我！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "70f75840e05efdc397a5200d07cc073cfc4f96736cfdd4f6e4a2d26c41812824", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\nぎゅーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先～生！\n抱～紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "940d708a450d139bc58e1f4e7541b9b036175a1a4bfda9c193ce2caf391a3914", "ja": "うわっ麗花！？　ハグはダメだぞ、ハグは！", "zh": "哇，丽花！？不可以抱人啦，不可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "6e7e893ee03416823b745bb6ff96d58e8939b29de7e349ec82fe31b7b70e041d", "ja": "あれあれ、ダメですか？", "zh": "哎呀呀，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "47e7ea9ee467eb510901c6e39a298d236032251846cd086399ac2626b55d98c6", "ja": "今日のところは、言葉で勘弁してくれ……\n麗花、最高の演技だったぞ。本当に頑張ったな！", "zh": "今天就先用语言表达一下，饶了我吧……\n丽花，刚才的演技太棒了。你真的很努力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "0654519dd62a27d8f82709786988cbdab36ab62acc49d999f32f02e0fa65f3e3", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　あっ、でも\nお礼を言いたいことが、他にもあって。", "zh": "谢谢您♪　啊，不过\n我还有别的事想要向您道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "2ba4f9ad1f1f29f7aff8ea6a2d2de2ecacd1a629e0d04a6f9f8b8cd6995c0dc8", "ja": "私、お芝居をしている途中、チトセくんと\nお友達になれたかも？って思ったんです！", "zh": "我在演戏的过程中，感觉自己好像和千岁同学成为朋友了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "60e4ef12911e567666c7766b396764be49a9c459cba13aa686f6875ee835f641", "ja": "はい♪　チトセくんが、私の手をぎゅーって\n握り返してくれたみたいな、そんな気がしました！", "zh": "是这样呀♪我感觉千岁君好像也紧紧地回握了我的手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "a704f262c88fabb9000ab895ed64a20f8577a0ace9cfe82a9936bcdcf7bed1aa", "ja": "映画が終わって、チトセくんはリイチさんや\nカナエくんとさよならしましたけど……。", "zh": "电影结束后，千岁君和理一先生、加奈江君道别了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "5ca535bc35145ada261196839e8475980eb4643e7afd4f2b7c8ff17f71682d64", "ja": "3人は、友達になったんだなーって思いました！\nだからきっと、チトセくんは大丈夫です！　えっへん♪", "zh": "我觉得，他们3个人已经成为朋友了呢！\n所以千岁君一定没问题的！哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a27013a0415eda83f0aeb023be9f054851b5fba303e8aed2a8508ae6c35c839a", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。なんといっても、\n麗花が本気で向き合った相手だもんな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。毕竟，那可是丽花认真面对过的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "5d72ae19f45753d54c1af4c0260ab1ff255c8a52da33aa76736441f00a1a0850", "ja": "はい！　今から、映画の公開が楽しみです。\nみんながチトセくんのことを知ってくれますし……。", "zh": "是！我现在就开始期待电影上映了。这样大家也能认识千岁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0308_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_07_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "bfbadb7ed189e6ab9d8db24491a9bb5db27bca7f45c00921b7f9c6cc9765c47a", "ja": "そしたらきっと、あの子と友達になりたいって人が、\nきっともっと、たくさん見つかると思いますから♪", "zh": "这样一来，一定会有更多想和那孩子成为朋友的人出现的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
